WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Today, Trump held an Antifa roundtable at the White House

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.000
and invited the real journalists

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.600
who have been on the ground.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.040
Secretary Noem hitched a red-eye from Portland

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:11.960
and reports there's a major cover-up.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:15.400
They are absolutely covering up the terrorism

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.080
that is hitting their streets.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:19.080
The damage that they've done, these leaders

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:22.160
in these local cities, along with Pritzker and Johnson,

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:24.000
ignore what's going on or, sir,

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.540
they're helping Antifa cover it up.

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:28.879
Antifa's assailants are assaulting reporters,

00:00:28.879 --> 00:00:31.780
giving them black eyes, and cops are letting them off.

